  "Metadata": {
    "Summary": "Auto-rigs humanoid meshes in the editor: detects landmarks, builds and skins a skeleton, and checks deformation.",
    "Description": "An editor tool that turns an unrigged humanoid mesh (Fbx, Obj, Gltf or Glb) into a rigged, skinned character. Open View > Humanoid Rigger, check the detected body and hand points, pick a rig profile and generate; every joint is stress-tested before you can save. Saves Vmdl, Fbx, Gltf, Glb or Obj. Editor-only: nothing from it ships in your game.",
    "WebsiteUrl": "https://github.com/zeljkovranjes/sbox-humanoid-rigger",
